    {
      "formId": "0040D82B",
      "edid": "WU_HolotapePlaceholder02",
      "name": "Alex's Observations 2",
      "location": "WU Holotape Placeholder 02",
      "contents": "From the Desk of Alex Wood:\n- It took me forever to get to the shopping plaza near Garages A and B.\nThis used to be a bustling hub of commerce, but now it's empty.\nIt's cleaner than I remember it ever being, almost like it's opening day tomorrow.\nWhen I was a kid I would get noodles at Captain Wong's Stir Fry - I kind of liked how sketchy it was, like an all ages dive bar.",
      "canCollect": true,
      "isCut": false
    },
    {
      "formId": "0040D829",
      "edid": "WU_HolotapePlaceholder01",
      "name": "Alex's Observations 8",
      "location": "WU Holotape Placeholder 01",
      "contents": "From the Desk of Alex Wood:\n- I've worked my way into what remains of Watoga's Underground Automated Parking Facility - it's surprisingly quiet and clean compared to what I expected.\nHuge portions of the the facility are locked and inaccessible.\nThe security robots are hostile, but I've been able to evade them so far.\nI'm going to press on into the storage areas soon.",
      "canCollect": true,
      "isCut": false
    },
